  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, toss together the cucumbers, onion, and radishes. In a separate bowl, mix the mayonnaise and Ranch dressing. Season with salt and pepper. Mix into the vegetables. Chill in the refrigerator at least 2 hours before serving.",
